      "message": "[error] Line 421: 🔴 `start()` has already removed this attachment from the queue when `download()` is called. Any transient daemon/D-Bus exception therefore reaches `finish()` and drops the file permanently; unlike a request the daemon accepted, no pending request exists to retry. Requeue the attachment with an appropriate retry policy, or retain explicit failed work/fallback state rather than treating every exception as terminal, otherwise the promise to download every attachment is not met.",
