      "message": "[error] Line 432: 🔴 A stalled attachment is erased from the queue after 10 seconds even though the daemon still owns the pending request, so `hasWork()` becomes false and this removes the conversation from `attachmentSyncConversations`. If the history page arrives afterward, normal size-limited auto-accept resumes and a file above the threshold can remain awaiting host instead of being synchronized. Keep a separate per-conversation pending-sync state for stalled daemon requests, and only re-enable fallback once the attachment is truly complete or intentionally abandoned.",
